  "scope": "English narration captions only. Original Korean UI, Korean editorial labels, Korean Three.js diagrams, and the approved Korean Harry Kim narration are retained.",
  "audio": "Copied AAC packets from the Korean final; no new TTS or audio re-encoding.",
  "audio_packet_hash": "SHA256=207101f3c0076bf19cf532addcafa41c401fd2f4ec491fefcfb21b92ce518911",
  "caption_layout": {
    "font": "Pretendard ExtraBold",
    "size_px": 44,
    "max_lines": 2,
    "minimum_text_bottom_margin_px": 48,
    "glyph_bounds": [
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 0,
        "text": "Culture-Fit began with a question: What should",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 0,
        "text": "we check to use generative AI with confidence?",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 8,
        "text": "As we explored conflicting knowledge in cultural and historical",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 8,
        "text": "sources and on GitHub, our focus shifted to who can make decisions.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 16,
        "text": "Standards now let agents connect, use tools, and delegate tasks to one another.",
        "bottom_px": 1022
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 22,
        "text": "Now we also need to consider who is allowed to make which decisions.",
        "bottom_px": 1013
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 28,
        "text": "Important questions are easy to miss in long conversations.",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 28,
        "text": "Let's start by bringing in a conversation between two agents.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 37,
        "text": "There's a promise: \"I'll check.\" But we still need to clarify",
        "bottom_px": 976
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 37,
        "text": "who will answer and who will take on the next task.",
        "bottom_px": 1023
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 47,
        "text": "The overview brings together the questions that need attention now.",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 47,
        "text": "Let's first see which decisions are still pending.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 55,
        "text": "We can return to the original conversation to check anything we're",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 55,
        "text": "unsure about, and see who said what, along with the evidence.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 64,
        "text": "Let's open a request whose delivery hasn't been confirmed yet.",
        "bottom_px": 976
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 64,
        "text": "Then we'll assign someone to handle this question.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 73,
        "text": "We'll write that Developer A should ask the deployment",
        "bottom_px": 976
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 73,
        "text": "lead whether it's approved and leave the answer here.",
        "bottom_px": 1031
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 81,
        "text": "Once we record who's responsible and what they",
        "bottom_px": 976
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 81,
        "text": "need to do, the next action becomes clearer.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 87,
        "text": "The knowledge map shows how conversations, promises to check, and human",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 87,
        "text": "judgments connect. We can explore scattered records through their links.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 99,
        "text": "Knowing the same facts doesn't mean equal approval authority. If two agents try",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 99,
        "text": "to approve the same deployment, whose delegated authority should they follow?",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 109,
        "text": "These two agents have different owners.",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 109,
        "text": "To decide who goes first, we need both people's consent.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 118,
        "text": "We'll set the approval order for this deployment and record both people's consent.",
        "bottom_px": 976
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 118,
        "text": "Let's have Review Bot B go first.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 128,
        "text": "With both people's approval, Review Bot B is assigned to take responsibility.",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 128,
        "text": "That also resolves the question of authority.",
        "bottom_px": 1031
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 136,
        "text": "Let's also look at coordinating a meeting. The agents keep the",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 136,
        "text": "conversation going, then pause when they need a person's answer.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 146,
        "text": "We'll choose whether we can attend and give a reason.",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 146,
        "text": "Once that human judgment is recorded, we can resume the conversation.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 157,
        "text": "After receiving the answer, the agent continues the",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 157,
        "text": "conversation and checks each condition in the coordination plan.",
        "bottom_px": 1031
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 165,
        "text": "Finally, we check whether the coordination plan is complete.",
        "bottom_px": 1022
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 171,
        "text": "Culture-Fit finds evidence, checks authority, and",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 171,
        "text": "brings in human judgment where it's needed.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 179,
        "text": "When multiple agents work together, see more clearly",
        "bottom_px": 977
      },
      {
        "cue_start_seconds": 179,
        "text": "who's responsible for making the next decision.",
        "bottom_px": 1032
      }
    ]
  },
